      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650068006500680065002C0020006400610020006200690073007400200077006F0068006C00200064007500200061006C0073002000100004110000FF090700000054007200610069006E006500720054007200610069006E006500720069006E000A007A0075007200FC0063006B00670065007300630068007200650063006B0074002E001000020114014F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
